# Cloudflare Pages. Private links are one pre-rendered page each, with the token in the query string
# (/invoice/?t=…, /contract/?t=…, /client-gallery/?id=…&k=…). Older path-style links keep working:
/invoice/:token/    /invoice/?t=:token    301
/invoice/:token     /invoice/?t=:token    301
/contract/:token/   /contract/?t=:token   301
/contract/:token    /contract/?t=:token   301
